  speakers: 0100000001000000000000000100000000000000010000000100000001000000
  dialogue:
  - Hi there! I'm Dr. Wrasse, welcome to My Shiny Teeth and Me!
  - Would you like a cleaning or whitening before you pitch to the sharks? A bright
    smile makes the best first impression!
  - I already pitched my idea and they laughed at me.
  - "Aww I\u2019m sorry kid. What\u2019s the idea?"
  - "It\u2019s an app that helps businesses connect with talent. It's called LinkedFin."
  - 'Oh, that sounds useful! '
  - "I\u2019ve been looking to expand my business with an xray technician but I don\u2019t
    have time to recruit while I\u2019m at ReefCon because I\u2019m too busy working
    the dentist chair."
  - I'll download your app!
